    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Armor (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbarmShield0000]{Shield}), Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>Crude metal spikes adorn this magic Shield. It has the following properties that you can use while holding it.</p><p><strong><em>Shield Bash.</em></strong> When you take the Attack action, you can make one of the attack rolls using the Shield against a target within 5 feet of yourself. Apply your Proficiency Bonus and Strength modifier to the attack roll. On a hit, the Shield deals Piercing damage equal to 2d6 plus your Strength modifier.</p><p><strong><em>Spike Salvo.</em></strong> As a Magic action, you can cause spikes to erupt from the Shield in a 30-foot Cone. Each creature in the Cone makes a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. Once this property is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
